{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5058389","formula":"C₃₂H₃₄O₁₉","hill":"C32H34O19","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":32.0,"H":34.0,"O":19.0},"names":{"en":"Cellulose acetate phthalate"},"descriptions":{"en":"Cellulose acetate phthalate (CAP), also known as cellacefate (INN) and cellulosi acetas phthalas, is a commonly used polymer phthalate in the formulation of pharmaceuticals, such as the enteric coating of tablets or capsules and for controlled release formulations. It is a cellulose polymer where about half of the hydroxyls are esterified with acetyls, a quarter are esterified with one or two carboxyls of a phthalic acid, and the remainder are unchanged. It is a hygroscopic white to off-white free-flowing powder, granules, or flakes."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":53315792,"mass":722.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(=O)OC[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@@H](O1)O[C@@H]2[C@H](O[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H]2O)OC(=O)C3=CC=CC=C3C(=O)O)O)COC(=O)C)O)OC(=O)C4=CC=CC=C4C(=O)O)O","inchikey":"DMNFZTKVDDFCQE-WJXNTJCASA-N","iupac":"2-[(2R,3R,4S,5R,6S)-2-(acetyloxymethyl)-6-[(2R,3S,4S,5R,6R)-2-(acetyloxymethyl)-5-(2-carboxybenzoyl)oxy-4,6-dihydroxyoxan-3-yl]oxy-3,5-dihydroxyoxan-4-yl]oxycarbonylbenzoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"53315792","atoms":85,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.024,"y":1.325,"z":5.089,"el":"C"},{"x":1.697,"y":2.549,"z":4.291,"el":"C"},{"x":2.19,"y":3.652,"z":4.482,"el":"O"},{"x":0.799,"y":2.242,"z":3.317,"el":"O"},{"x":0.465,"y":3.336,"z":2.444,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.313,"y":2.792,"z":1.233,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.65,"y":2.162,"z":1.65,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.332,"y":1.509,"z":0.44,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.382,"y":0.662,"z":-0.409,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.035,"y":1.358,"z":-0.659,"el":"C"},{"x":0.521,"y":1.83,"z":0.571,"el":"O"},{"x":0.934,"y":0.444,"z":-1.